 "remarks": "BUILDERS & DEVELOPERS TAKE NOTICE! RARE LAND OPPORTUNITY FOR SALE IN NORTH STAMFORD WITH POSSIBILITIES! 2.12-acre parcel in a highly desirable North Stamford location, zoned RA-1, offering exciting potential for a future two-lot residential subdivision, subject to required approvals: zoning, engineering and municipal approvals. A compelling opportunity for builders, developers and investors seeking land in one of Stamford's most sought-after residential areas. An exceptional opportunity to create one or two Luxury residences in a desirable North Stamford setting surrounded by established neighborhood and beautiful homes. Unlock the potential and create something special in this exceptional location. Property is being marketed and sold AS IS, LAND ONLY. Existing improvements convey as is; the opportunity is in the land. Bring your vision and create something exceptional. Convenient location with easy access to major commuting routes, shopping, dining, beaches, theater and all The City of Stamford has to offer. Bring your vision and create something exceptional. Buyer to do all due diligence. CASH-ONLY PREFERRED. Please DO NOT walk the property without a confirmed appointment.",
